      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release of Shift.

- Run several coding tasks in parallel with Claude Code or Codex, each in its own Git worktree, branch and dev server.
- Test each task in your browser, look at the diff, and merge into your base branch.
- Answer agent questions and approvals from the app; get notified when a task is ready.
- Push merged work to your remote.]]></description>
